# 🔍 DRY RUN

### First render:

url = "/api/users"

→ cache empty
→ fetch called
→ loading = true

---

### API responds:

→ data stored in cache
→ loading = false

---

### Component re-renders:

→ same URL
→ cache hit
→ no fetch

---

### URL changes:

→ abort old request
→ fetch new one

